OL,3,A'Human' is Cambridge Dictionary Word of
OL,4,Athe Year
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Human" is the Cambridge Dictionary's
OL,7,FWord of the Year ` defined as "having
OL,8,Fthe qualities, faults, and feelings
OL,9,Fthat people have, as opposed to gods,
OL,10,Fanimals, or machines".
OL,12,F"The growth of AI means it is now
OL,13,Fnecessary to explicitly say 'human' for
OL,14,Fthings that once could only be done by
OL,15,Fhumans," said chief editor Colin
OL,16,FMcIntosh.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
