OL,3,A'Human' is Cambridge Dictionary Word of
OL,4,Athe Year
OL,5,
OL,6,FExamples of current usage included
OL,7,Factors Scarlett Johansson challenging
OL,8,F"an assault on human creativity" and
OL,9,FMatthew McConaughey protecting himself
OL,10,Fagainst unauthorised digital
OL,11,Freproduction of his voice or image.
OL,13,F"The measure of AI's success should be
OL,14,Fhow much it improves human lives," said
OL,15,FMicrosoft co-founder Bill Gates on
OL,16,Flearning about the dictionary's choice.
